  "_README": "ClawArena-Team main-agent evaluation target registry. Each entry's `main` is injected via `-m` JSON; the subagent pool comes from configs/eval_base.yaml (local gemma). `main` only declares text -- non-text inputs are handled by the vlm/omni subagents (ClawArena-Team design). Targets that use `api_key_env` read the key from the environment (export GEMINI_API_KEY / OPENROUTER_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY before running run_eval_targets.py). Start the dependent services first: gemini/openrouter connect directly to the cloud; codex needs a ChatMock-style proxy (:8920); bedrock needs litellm (:4000); local-* needs serve_main_agent.py (:8910). The 127.0.0.1 api_base values and `api_key: EMPTY`/`anything` placeholders are for these local proxies and carry no secrets.",
